{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A sorted set kept in a red–black tree: a binary search tree whose vertices are red or black,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with no red vertex under a red one and the same number of black vertices on every path from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"root down (Guibas and Sedgewick, 1978).","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/SK","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/Sl","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/Se","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/SE","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/SQ","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/s25ExpressibleByArrayLiteralP","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/SH","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/Sk","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/ST","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/s10SetAlgebraP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/init()","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/init(_:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/height"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/elements(in:)-37c2j","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/Re